{
  "_comment": [
    "Static model metadata table, keyed by client -> model id.",
    "Every number here is ported verbatim from an authoritative source; an empty field",
    "means 'no source', which is a correct value. A guessed field is a bug.",
    "context_length/max_output_tokens are used for client-wide values; limits_by_realm",
    "overrides them when the same client publishes different CN/Global limits.",
    "efforts are realm-split on purpose (see efforts_by_realm + effort_origin).",
    "`origin` says where context_length/max_output_tokens came from;",
    "`effort_origin` says where efforts/default_effort came from."
  ],
